        <section class="home-service-wrapper">
            <div class="home-service home-service-left">
                <div class="home-service-content">
                    <h3>History of Tembo House Hotel</h3>
                    <p class="pt-2 pt-lg-3 pb-3 pb-lg-4">
                        Tembo House Hotel is a legacy of great history and one of Zanzibar's foremost witnesses
                        throughout its growth. The building that today is the Tembo House Hotel has lived through much
                        of Zanzibar’s modern history and housed some of its most famous guests.
                    </p>
                    <a href="" class="d-flex align-items-center">Explore More <i
                            class="fi fi-rs-arrow-right ps-1 ms-2"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="home-service-image">
                    <div class="swiper attractionSwiper">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/home-service2.webp" alt="Brand 1"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/histo2.webp" alt="Brand 2"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/histo1.webp" alt="Brand 3"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-service home-service-right">
                <div class="home-service-image">
                    <div class="swiper attractionSwiper">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/attraction1.webp" alt="Brand 1"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/attraction2.webp" alt="Brand 2"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://tembohotel.com/wp-content/themes/tembo-hotel/images/attraction3.webp" alt="Brand 3"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="home-service-content">
                    <h3>Attractions</h3>
                    <p class="pt-2 pt-lg-3 pb-3 pb-lg-4">
                        Tembo's ideal location in Zanzibar gives you a perfect launchpad to all the exciting locations
                        on the island. From boat rides to exotic islands, a drive to the spice farms or a quick walk
                        around Stone Town, at Tembo you can do it all.
                    </p>
                    <a href="" class="d-flex align-items-center">Explore More <i
                            class="fi fi-rs-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-aminities-wrapper">
            <div class="home-aminities-intro">
                <div class="container-rigid">
                    <h2 class="pb-1 pb-md-2">Experience Tembo hotel Aminities</h2>
                    <p>
                        At Tembo House Hotel, we offer a thoughtfully curated selection of amenities to enhance your
                        stay. Enjoy leisure and entertainment in our private cinema, complete with a snack bar. Unwind
                        by the swimming pool or stroll through our lush gardens, perfect for quiet reflection or
                        gatherings. Our well-equipped gym offers a private, energetic space. Each amenity is designed to
                        provide a comprehensive and refined experience.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

