                <div class="swiper feedback-swiper">
                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">❝ Such a beautiful experience. I stayed there a whole week. The
                                food
                                is amazing and the staff are great. My Yusuf the manager is a very warm and welcoming
                                person and cares about the comfort of his clients. Well done Tembo. ❞</p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">James M., <span>Business Traveler</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">
                                ❝ Amazing studio located in a nice quiet area but close to everything. The room is so
                                spacious, the bed was comfortable all the facilities in the room were great. Beautiful
                                view I didn’t expect to be able to see the sea ! 100% recommend this hotel ❞
                            </p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">Sarah L., <span>Leisure Guest</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">
                                ❝ Very charming hotel. The staff was excellent. My room was a sea view room with a
                                balcony. I had a partial view of the sea only after walking out to the balcony. ❞
                            </p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">Alex Timami, <span>Returning Guest</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">
                                ❝ Exceptional stay! Smooth check-in, friendly staff, and a spotless, spacious room with
                                all the essentials. Housekeeping was consistently excellent. ❞
                            </p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">James M., <span>Business Traveler</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">
                                ❝ Charming colonial hotel. Room was spacious, very comfortable, well-appointed and
                                clean. The three pools were excellent. On the beach right in the middle of Stone Town.
                                Staff was excellent. ❞
                            </p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">Sarah L., <span>Leisure Guest</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide feedback-card">
                            <p class="feedback-text">
                                ❝ This hotel is prob the best value in all of Stone Town. Breakfast buffet is top notch
                                & the views are incredible. Live music at night & next door to another place that has
                                live music. Perfect walking distance to town. ❞
                            </p>
                            <p class="feedback-author">Alex Timami, <span>Returning Guest</span></p>
                        </div>

